, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Ztbcpzx9sQdNQnKx8yghTA","review_id":"zYriVbspsiEpjevkJ1k7Ag","date":"2021-03-03T03:38:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9500105381011963,"text_excerpt":"Such a fun hang-out spot! We arrived here Saturday night around 6:30pm with no reservations. The hostess informed us that we could order cocktails and head upstairs until our table was ready so I went with the house margarita and my +1 got a tall Paradise Park. Upstairs, you'll find appropriately spaced out tables filled with patrons waiting for a table downstairs -- I did see a few people eating upstairs but this option wasn't offered to us and I wanted to eat downstairs anyway so we didn't explore this option. Our 'table' was ready right around the time we finished our first round. We followed a very polite server to the elevator and ultimately to our table downstairs. Once at our table..."},{"business_id":"Ztbcpzx9sQdNQnKx8yghTA","review_id":"JA4O7wpey_QckZuGs-bNLw","date":"2020-08-09T00:48:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9466148614883423,"text_excerpt":"So glad there is now a restaurant attached to Rusty Nail! Sidecar is everything any more. The aesthetic is amazing! Patio vibes meets upscale bar - idk my version of what it is. Right now, there is a hostess to greet you and walk you through there social distancing route. You have to wait to be call to enter the \"bar\" where they take your order, drinks, food, and then they'll give you a number. You can sit whatever and they have waiters serving you after you have order your first time. They are trying to minimize the walking around obviously and they are doing a great job at it. The food was great, little pricey for a burger and fries, but honestly would eat it again. I'm not really a bur..."},{"business_id":"Ztbcpzx9sQdNQnKx8yghTA","review_id":"2hZG-aleLHc6DnRQKLWKBQ","date":"2020-10-19T15:44:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.932072639465332,"text_excerpt":"When you are looking for somewhere to enjoy the fall weather with delicious food and drink, check out Sidecar! Their food menu options aren't the most extensive, but everything that we did order was fresh and delicious. Heads up though: it is a lot of seafood so if you're not a seafood fan, eat before! The outdoor seating area is def my favorite part. There are tv's everywhere for football games and the aesthetic is just really nice and calming. Tables are socially distanced and the staff is taking precautions. As for the food, yum! The oysters were tasty and came with cocktail sauce and horseradish. The chicken sandwich was juicy and priced well. The crab cake sandwich was okay, I don't ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Ztbcpzx9sQdNQnKx8yghTA","photo_id":"09FOs5esCNMXStpQse59CA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/09FOs5esCNMXStpQse59CA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.892197847366333},{"business_id":"Ztbcpzx9sQdNQnKx8yghTA","photo_id":"6S1Wb0AHap53A5Jo9xIQwQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/6S1Wb0AHap53A5Jo9xIQwQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8742514252662659},{"business_id":"Ztbcpzx9sQdNQnKx8yghTA","photo_id":"phhkrutybntNeq_uA7VVhg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/phhkrutybntNeq_uA7VVhg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.836301326751709},{"business_id":"Ztbcpzx9sQdNQnKx8yghTA","photo_id":"UGDXQ8LdBTcg_mrOJpgc9Q","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/UGDXQ8LdBTcg_mrOJpgc9Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8217371702194214},{"business_id":"Ztbcpzx9sQdNQnKx8yghTA"